        <type><ref refid="baremetal_2arm__cortex__m_2inc_2edf__core_8h_1ab65351184e17503508d8092f85a75d38" kindref="member">EDF_core_schedStatus_t</ref></type>
        <definition>EDF_core_schedStatus_t EDF_core_lockScheduler</definition>
        <argsstring>(uint8_t ceiling)</argsstring>
        <name>EDF_core_lockScheduler</name>
        <param>
          <type>uint8_t</type>
          <declname>ceiling</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para><anchor id="baremetal_2arm__cortex__m_2src_2edf__core_8c_1internal_access_via_macros_only"/></para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Internal access via macros only</title><para></para>
</simplesect>
The following functions are not meant to be called directly from external modules. They are exposed only for documentation purposes and to allow access through the public macros defined in this header.</para>
<para>Raises the scheduler lock ceiling.</para>
<para>Prevents preemption by active objects with a priority at or below the specified ceiling.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">ceiling</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>New lock ceiling priority. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Previous scheduler lock state. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
